From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:32:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] bugfix: discover configured voice test executables

Build the actual rust_test targets and query their configured executable
providers so verification does not depend on nonexistent test-bin labels
or assumed output paths. Preserve failures and complete evidence.

Windows CRT staging rewrites runtime.json after the runtime stage copied it
from Bazel's read-only output, so the write failed with a permission error.
Make the manifest writable first, as sealing does, and write it with line
feeds so the Windows interpreter does not translate them.
